    "body": "Fixes #6851.\n\nComparing two typed memoryview slices could generate an invalid C comparison between structs. Report an invalid-type error after the comparison's full common type is determined, while retaining comparisons with `None` and chains that are coerced to Python objects.\n\nTests: targeted Cython error and runtime tests with both C and C++ backends on x86-64 and aarch64; existing comparison error tests on x86-64.\n\nAI assistance: OpenAI Codex assisted with the implementation and tests.\n",
